		{"id":"bed1e685950c801c","type":"text","text":"Lex Breaker Science Corporation\n\nEstablished 2002\n\nMost \n2nd most popular and successful tech business","x":240,"y":-579,"width":400,"height":163},
		{"id":"a9e9d0bf59245a6d","type":"text","text":"Lex's science and tech works are popular for (mostly) being cheap enough to be in the realm of possibility of purchasing and using for the average citizen.\n\nBut some of Lex's creations are using unstable elements.\nLex knows that but doesn't care.\n\nThey can kill their users or just badly hurt them.\nPoison them.\n\nIn 2211 Epoch 1 Chapter 2 for example, Kaven Varlet is using Lex Breaker's tech and it's poisoning him.","x":720,"y":-413,"width":590,"height":300}
